WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.210
>>>>>

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.350
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.620
This never-ending LOOP,

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.840
a cycle that goes out of spin,

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.270
and runs towards you.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.740
Under this bright sunlight,

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.040
and blue sky,

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:30.540
I’m accelerating so fast that I can’t stop moving.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.690
It’s my first time having these feelings.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.450
What should I do? My throbbing heart doesn’t know,

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:46.590
and keeps searching for the solution, even now.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.720
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.400
I am here because of your kiss,

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.350
which has stopped the flow of time.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.870
I knock on the door to your heart,

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.870
and watch your wavering dreams.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.640
Your RUBY eyes are what absorb me in.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.550
Barely in sight,

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:15.880
the translucent door to your heart looks like it is opening now.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:20.400
Only you...

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.830
my kiss will reach...

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:43.140
Good morning, onii-chan!

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:44.310
Morning!

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:48.190
Why are you bothering with your hair?

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:50.070
It's nothing, no real reason.

00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:52.280
Really?

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.240
It's kind of different from the usual.

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:56.410
Is something up?

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:58.330
N-Nothing's up.

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:03.250
How suspicious.

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:13.720
And so, we haven't found a heroine for the movie yet.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:17.640
Mao-neechan?

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:22.470
Watch out!

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:29.520
Are you all right?

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:30.900
I guess not.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.160
It's all because you were walking around while dazed.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.780
I was thinking about something.

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:41.660
Thinking about something? Did something happen?

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:44.080
You've been acting weird since yesterday.

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:01.350
I...!

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:06.190
I-It's nothing!

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:07.730
Of course nothing happened!

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:10.360
We'll be late if we don't hurry up!

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:12.070
She <i>is</i> acting weird.

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:16.820
Mao-neecha-

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:26.750
Kouichi!

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.630
What's up with Mao-neechan?

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.340
She's kind of different than usual.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:36.420
Yeah, she's been like that since yesterday.

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:42.300
What's wrong with Mao-neechan and onii-chan this morning?

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:44.310
Is something up with you, Kazuki?

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:45.850
It's nothing.

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:47.310
Don't bring me up!

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:49.440
Could it be you have a date?

00:03:50.190 --> 00:03:51.900
That's not it, idiot.

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:54.150
There's no way I have a date.

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:55.570
Reckless love, huh?

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:00.700
Don't just show up and say easily misunderstood things, Hiiragi!

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:04.280
Um, reckless what?

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:16.670
Crap.

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:25.430
I wonder what Kai-kun's intention was.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:33.020
Mizusawa.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:35.770
Ah, your shoes.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.650
Ah, I forgot about them!

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.070
Mizusawa!

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:46.740
About yesterday...

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:54.380
Class will start, so I'll be going on ahead.

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:03.340
I don't know how I should face him.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.930
I don't feel like going to class anymore.

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:09.770
Nagase-san?

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:10.390
Here.

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:12.390
Matsumoto-san?

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:13.150
Here.

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:20.570
Oh, she's not here. I wonder if she slept in?

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:22.610
Mishima-san?

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:23.660
Here.

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.030
Muratani-san?

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:46.930
Sorry, but I'm not feeling well, so I'd like to use a bed-

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:55.600
So we meet again.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:58.070
Futami Eriko-chan, was it?

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:02.240
Tajima-sensei isn't here again?

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:03.610
You can tell by looking, right?

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:05.610
I guess that's right.

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:09.410
Um, I'm sorry about last time.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.540
I just thought that you didn't like studying.

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:16.250
You were ranked first on the midterms. That's amazing.

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:18.250
It's nothing amazing.

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:20.380
No, it's really amazing.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.090
I really respect you.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:25.260
If you're that smart, you probably don't have much to worry about.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:27.640
I'm jealous of you.

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:31.390
I don't even know much about myself.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.060
Do you have any problems like that, Futami-san?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.350
No.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:37.440
I know myself the best.

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:44.320
Um, here.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:50.740
I thought it'd be a good reference for the culture festival movie.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:54.080
I've been wanting to watch that.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:56.750
I'm glad! Then...

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.290
Today...

00:06:58.290 --> 00:06:59.000
Eh?

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:01.210
Do you want to go... together?

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:05.220
Ah, I'm sorry!

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.680
It's okay if you don't want to go.

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:08.220
That's not it!

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:10.640
It was sudden, so I was caught off guard.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:11.560
So then...

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:14.430
Yes!

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:18.150
Let's meet up at Satonaka's later, Sanada.

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.560
I thought we didn't have any club activities today.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:22.900
This is no time to be saying things that.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:24.320
The script isn't even finished yet.

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:26.110
I guess.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:27.570
Sorry.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.120
No, don't worry about it.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.080
Aihara's not here.

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:34.370
Did he leave already?

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:46.880
Kouraiken.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:48.840
Let's go in.

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:52.510
Welcome!

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.020
I'm all stiff!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:59.940
Maybe I slept too much.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:08.490
So it's only us who gathered in the end.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:14.280
Shijou-san!

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:16.870
This is good timing!

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:20.040
I was thinking of heading to Satonaka's.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.790
Would you like to come along?

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:24.630
As expected of Shijou-san!

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.630
About this store's specialty-

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:32.590
Be quiet, I'm having a look.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:34.050
Okay.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:39.140
I wonder what we look like to others?

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:42.650
Hey, what's this puru-puru ramen?

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:46.400
Oh, that ramen has collagen in it.

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:46.400
Note: Collagen is one of the proteins responsible for the skin's strength and elasticity.

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:49.150
I see, that's why it's called puru-puru.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.070
What about this fuwa-fuwa ramen?

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:52.910
That's ramen with soy milk.

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:54.830
Soy milk...

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:57.290
They say it's good for diets.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.000
You're thin, so I don't think you-

00:08:59.000 --> 00:08:59.960
I'm the one choosing.

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:01.790
Okay.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.540
It probably doesn't look like a date at all.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:06.920
I've decided.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:08.420
Which one?

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:08.760
This one.

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:11.510
Berry-berry ramen?!

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:15.390
Berry-berry?

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:25.980
How unpleasant.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:31.030
Well, one berry-berry ramen and a fried rice for me.

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:31.860
All right.

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:39.830
Crap.

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:43.370
Only her elbow touched and... This isn't good.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.370
I guess I should talk about something.

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:37.430
Welcome!

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:39.390
I'll have the usual, mister!

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:41.220
Salted and buttered fried rice, right?

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.270
Yeah, make it a big portion, too.

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:45.140
Okay, a big portion, right?

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:48.520
Oh, Aihara-kun!

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:49.310
Sakino!

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.070
You're with Futami-san.

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:55.610
Ah, uh, yeah.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:10:58.740
Futami-san.

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:01.660
What are you doing?

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.950
I'm sorry about the other day.

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:04.620
The other day?

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:07.250
You know, in the library.

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.630
I think I said too much.

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:14.380
Ah, oh no!

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:16.590
I'm so hungry!

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:22.140
What? Is there something on my face?

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.310
You're a strange one.

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:27.940
I don't want to be told that by you!

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:29.560
That's true!

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:33.280
What are you laughing about?

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:35.150
You shouldn't laugh about it!

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:37.070
Apologize to Futami-san!

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:37.490
Why?!

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:39.530
She smiled!

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:41.320
You just smiled, didn't you?

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:45.040
That's the first time I've seen you smile!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.000
I didn't smile.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:47.040
You smiled.

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:48.670
I didn't smile.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.670
Calm down, calm down.

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:51.790
Here you go!

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:56.590
Isn't this berry-berry ramen?

00:11:58.550 --> 00:11:59.630
Could it be...

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.310
Then that means...

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:29.960
H-How is it?

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:31.880
It's good.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:33.960
Are you serious?

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:13.880
Um, Kai-kun...

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:15.590
Um...

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:20.760
I'm sorry for suddenly saying those things yesterday.

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:26.180
I didn't say them with half-hearted feelings, though.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:27.930
Kai-kun...

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:30.230
I love you, Mizusawa.

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.690
Will you go out with me?

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:41.570
Thank you.

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:48.580
I'm not sure of my own feelings yet, but...

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:53.540
I'll try to think of you more seriously from now on.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:56.460
Is that okay?

00:13:57.380 --> 00:13:59.550
Yeah, that's fine.

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:05.590
These kinds of things are sort of embarrassing, huh?

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:10.640
Hey, do you want to go out and play? We'll go all out!

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:19.770
Amazing. This is my first time seeing someone enjoy that.

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:21.730
Your bad taste is conclusive now.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:24.740
Deciding with only this evidence is quite rash.

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:27.660
Eh? Futami-san has bad taste?

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:29.910
Or rather, we came to test that.

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:31.740
So that's why she chose berry-berry.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:33.540
Let's do another test.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:35.120
Another test?

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:38.330
That's right, a larger sample is better, right?

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:42.130
Are there any other stores with menus like this one?

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:43.800
No...

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:47.470
If we're going to confirm her bad taste, we should go to a good store.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.010
I have a good place in mind then.

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:56.560
If you don't like the food at the store we're going to,

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:58.560
it'll be definitive that you have bad taste, all right?

00:14:59.020 --> 00:14:59.770
I understand.

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.820
Hold up! I'm going too!

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:05.090
Satonaka Udon

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:08.990
Eh? You've never come to love anyone before?

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:10.990
Is it strange?

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:14.330
You have a fiancé, don't you?

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.370
What about him?

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:18.920
We've never met yet.

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.040
Eh? You've never met him?

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:23.510
Are you okay with that?

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:23.940
shinsaku

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:28.220
You're right, I had thought it was natural.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:25.150
New udon no kenkyuu

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.490
New Udon Research

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:32.760
I hope you can come to love him.

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:34.770
Thank you.

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:39.560
Um, do you mind if I ask you all a question?

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:40.900
Ask anything.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:45.360
How does it feel to love someone?

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:48.360
At what moment do you start to think like that?

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:52.580
Explain it to her, Sanada.

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:54.160
Why me?

00:15:56.450 --> 00:16:00.830
Let's see... If the person you like is happy,

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:03.750
you become happy yourself, or something like that.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.460
What about you, Yuumi-san?

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:12.350
For me, when I finally realized it, all I did was think about that person.

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:15.100
It's like they just won't leave my mind.

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:18.520
Hey, aren't they preparing?

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.400
It's okay, it's okay!

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:23.650
Onii-chan!

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.320
Aihara, what were you doing?

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:27.690
What am I doing?

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:29.360
Why are you guys here?

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:30.860
We don't have club activities, right?

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:33.240
The person from the library...

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:41.250
All right!

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.420
I lost, again?

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:46.590
That makes it my tenth win in a row.

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.130
This is quite a surprise.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:49.760
I didn't know you liked games.

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:52.430
This is the only one I can play, though.

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:55.560
I talked to you about my childhood friend, right?

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:57.640
The one I'm living with.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.850
The one you studied with.

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:01.060
That's right.

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:03.020
His name is Kouichi.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:06.940
He got a girlfriend recently and doesn't play with me anymore.

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:10.400
So he's called Kouichi.

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:12.990
I've been calling him that since we were little.

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.530
He calls me Mao-neechan too.

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:19.290
You two get along well?

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:23.920
Yeah, we grew up together as if we were siblings.

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:31.920
This is good!

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:32.760
Isn't it?

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:36.140
The noodles are good, the dashi is good, it's perfect!

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:41.930
It's quite a surprise to find out that Futami-san has bad taste, though.

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:44.440
It hasn't been decided yet.

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:46.230
She has her preferences, too.

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:50.690
I don't think there's anyone who'd say the udon here is bad,

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:52.820
no matter how picky they are.

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:54.700
That's true.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:58.910
I didn't hear anything about them going to Kouraiken.

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:07.540
How's the taste of Satonaka's udon, Futami-san?

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:09.340
It's good.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.590
About as good as the one before.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:16.510
About as good? You mean as good as the berry-berry ramen?

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:18.100
R-Really?

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:19.810
No way...

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:22.270
This is quite serious.

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:37.030
Your grandpa is quite the gourmet.

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:41.040
Yeah, he's the type that works hard against adversity.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:44.250
Your bad taste is decided for sure, now.

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:46.540
Well, either way,

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:51.380
I feel quite honored to be able to talk to Futami-san like this.

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:54.760
I only came here to eat udon.

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:57.470
You're quite harsh.

00:18:57.970 --> 00:19:00.930
Um, it's late for introductions, but...

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:05.890
Nice to meet you. I'm Nana, Aihara Kazuki's sister.

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:09.690
What kind of relationship do you have with my brother?

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:13.400
Idiot, what are you saying?!

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:15.820
But, but I'm worried!

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:20.030
You two went alone to eat ramen, isn't that a date?

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:22.330
It's not like that.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:27.080
Then what kind of...

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:28.420
A friend?

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:30.920
I have no friends.

00:19:39.430 --> 00:19:39.930
I'm leaving.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:55.610
I felt kind of nervous.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:57.200
Me too.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:20:00.160
Still, to think that Futami-san has bad taste.

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:02.660
You're still saying that?

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:05.950
We're more familiar with her now after hanging out, though.

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:12.960
That was fun!

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.090
Let's go again.

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:14.920
Yeah.

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:50.220
See you all tomorrow.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:51.670
Take care!

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:53.290
Bye, Naru-chan!

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:54.870
Bye, Nana-chan!

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:01.590
When should we go watch the movie?

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:04.300
I can go anytime.

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:06.470
When is a good time for you, Sanada-kun?

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:09.560
Let's see... How about next Sunday?

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.410
Mao-neechan...

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:26.120
Kouichi...

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.980
kowaresou de

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.980
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:38.940
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:38.940
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.650
wasarenai yo

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.650
I won’t forget

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:47.410
hoshi ni negai o

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:47.410
that wish upon a star.

00:21:55.620 --> 00:22:00.130
kyou shitsu no sumi ni wa itsumo fushigi bako

00:21:55.620 --> 00:22:00.130
The strange box lying in the corner of the classroom;

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.500
dare ni mo misenai shi

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.500
I won’t show it to anyone.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.300
itsumo minai furi

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.300
I always pretend not to see it.

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:11.220
hajimete okutte moratta hoshi no yoru

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:11.220
The first time you walked me home during that starry night.

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:13.600
ano kajitsu mo

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:13.600
The fruit

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:16.180
mada tabetenai kedo

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:16.180
I have not eaten.

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.020
honki de butsukatta

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.020
I struck it with all my might.

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:21.810
naite sawaida

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:21.810
I cried and I screamed.

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:30.320
shinkei wa kitto kinui totokoutetsu de dekiteta

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:30.320
I’m certain nerves are made from silk and steel.

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:32.950
osaekirenai

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:32.950
My insuppressible feelings

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:36.960
omoi o nagete negai boshi ni

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:36.960
are cast on a wishing star.

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:38.580
ima kakeru yo

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:38.580
It’s now time to run.

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:42.000
tobira no soto wa DAIAMONDO

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:42.000
Beyond the door are diamonds.

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:47.970
ikusen no yume kaki utsushita NOOTO ni

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:47.970
Thousands of dreams transcribed onto a notebook.

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:53.050
tojikometara ai ni yuku yo

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:53.050
Whenever I’m trapped I’m go see you.

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:59.020
kirakira toeien o kiritotta mamade

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:59.020
The sparkle and eternity are cut short.

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:03.980
yakusoku shita kimi to nara ano hi no KISU o

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:03.980
We made a promise with a kiss on that day.

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:06.030
kowaresou de

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:06.030
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:09.990
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:09.990
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:13.070
wasurenai yo

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:13.070
I won’t forget

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:19.040
hoshi ni negai o

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:19.040
that wish upon a star.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:40.060
Next Episode

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.760
It's finally time for the long-awaited swimming tournament!

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:30.040
I won't have any soccer practice,

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:32.170
but I've got to work hard doing this too!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:34.780
Swimming with all you've got feels really good!

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:35.780
Huh?

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:38.190
Mizusawa-senpai doesn't seem that energetic.
